</given-names></name><name><surname>Biran</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Diolez</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Bouchaud</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>ATP generation in the <italic>Trypanosoma brucei</italic> procyclic form: cytosolic substrate level is essential, but not oxidative phosphorylation.</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><volume>278</volume><fpage>49625</fpage><lpage>49635</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14506274</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ppat.1000436-Coustou2"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Coustou</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Biran</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Breton</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Guegan</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Riviere</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2008</year><article-title>Glucose-induced remodeling of intermediary and energy metabolism in procyclic <italic>Trypanosoma brucei</italic>.</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><volume>283</volume><fpage>16342</fpage><lpage>16354</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18430732</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ppat.1000436-Jensen1"><label>17</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jensen</surname><given-names>BC</given-names></name><name><surname>Kifer</surname><given-names>CT</given-names></name><name><surname>Brekken</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name><name><surname>Randall</surname><given-names>AC</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>Q</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Characterization of protein kinase CK2 from <italic>Trypanosoma brucei</italic>.</article-title><source>Mol Biochem